   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **TWOD 20170922 00 stage entrance**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 01 In Chains**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 02 Pain**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 03 An Ocean In Between The Waves**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 04 Strangest Thing**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 05 Holding On**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 06 Red Eyes**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **TWOD 20170922 07 Knocked Down**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2017-09-22.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 17 songs; 116 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Adam Granduciel handled vocals, guitar, harmonica, and sampler during the performance [1]\n- The recording was captured from the first row general admission area on the rail [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2017-09-22.flac16**: taped by larryrulz; transferred by larryrulz; source: master audience recording [1]. Also: Recorded with CA-14 cardioid mics into Sony M10 at 24/44, processed in Audacity [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Will Oliver: [The War On Drugs at Central Park Summerstage (September 22, 2017)](https://weallwantsomeone.org/2017/11/14/the-war-on-drugs-at-central-park-summerstage-september-22-2017/) [3]\n- Fan art by Will Oliver: [The War On Drugs at Central Park Summerstage (September 22, 2017)](https://weallwantsomeone.org/2017/11/14/the-war-on-drugs-at-central-park-summerstage-september-22-2017/) [4]\n- Fan art by Will Oliver: [The War On Drugs at Central Park Summerstage (September 22, 2017)](https://weallwantsomeone.org/2017/11/14/the-war-on-drugs-at-central-park-summerstage-september-22-2017/) [5]\n- Fan art by Will Oliver: [The War On Drugs at Central Park Summerstage (September 22, 2017)](https://weallwantsomeone.org/2017/11/14/the-war-on-drugs-at-central-park-summerstage-september-22-2017/) [6]\n- Fan art by Will Oliver: [The War On Drugs at Central Park Summerstage (September 22, 2017)](https://weallwantsomeone.org/2017/11/14/the-war-on-drugs-at-central-park-summerstage-september-22-2017/) [7]",
